{
  "sn55.27:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.27 ",
  "sn55.27:0.2": "3. Saraṇānivagga ",
  "sn55.27:0.3": "Dutiyaanāthapiṇḍikasutta ",
  "sn55.27:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn55.27:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena anāthapiṇḍiko gahapati ābādhiko hoti dukkhito bāḷhagilāno. ",
  "sn55.27:1.3": "Atha kho anāthapiṇḍiko gahapati aññataraṁ purisaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn55.27:1.4": "“ehi tvaṁ, ambho purisa, yenāyasmā ānando tenupasaṅkama; upasaṅkamitvā mama vacanena āyasmato ānandassa pāde sirasā vanda: ",
  "sn55.27:1.5": "‘anāthapiṇḍiko, bhante, gahapati ābādhiko dukkhito bāḷhagilāno. ",
  "sn55.27:1.6": "So āyasmato ānandassa pāde sirasā vandatī’ti. ",
  "sn55.27:1.7": "Evañca vadehi: ",
  "sn55.27:1.8": "‘sādhu kira, bhante, āyasmā ānando yena anāthapiṇḍikassa gahapatissa nivesanaṁ tenupasaṅkamatu anukampaṁ upādāyā’”ti. ",
  "sn55.27:2.1": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho so puriso anāthapiṇḍikassa gahapatissa paṭissutvā yenāyasmā ānando tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho so puriso āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn55.27:2.2": "“anāthapiṇḍiko, bhante, gahapati ābādhiko dukkhito bāḷhagilāno. ",
  "sn55.27:2.3": "So āyasmato ānandassa pāde sirasā vandati. ",
  "sn55.27:2.4": "Evañca vadati: ",
  "sn55.27:2.5": "‘sādhu kira, bhante, āyasmā ānando yena anāthapiṇḍikassa gahapatissa nivesanaṁ tenupasaṅk